<title>UK: Deutsche issues call/put warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Deutsche issues call/put warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital markets (Deutsche) has issued 16 million American-style call and put warrants, in 16 equal tranches, on the U.S. dollar and mark, lead manager Deutsche bank said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   18.OCT.96	   LISTING	FRFT, DUSS</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  US$/DEM - 1.5305  CURRENCY     MARKS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
